  augment /ni:network-instance/ni:instances/ni:instance/l3vpn:afs/l3vpn:af/rt:routing/rt:static-routing/rt:unicast-route2s/rt:unicast-route2/rt:nexthop-vrf-onlys/rt:nexthop-vrf-only/rt:track-setting {
